# Life and Limb: "All Forests and all Saprolings are 1/1 green Saproling creatures and Forest lands in addition to their
# other types." One effect in three layers (CR 613.6): layer 4 adds the types (CR 205.1b: Creature and the creature type
# Saproling, Land and the land type Forest - the ruling), layer 5 makes it green, layer 7b makes it 1/1. A Forest is a
# Saproling too after it, and a Saproling a Forest, but the effect applies once: it changes nothing about its own reach.
# - Bot1's Forest, played the turn Life and Limb arrives, is a 1/1 green Land Creature - Forest Saproling, summoning sick
#   (CR 302.6, the reminder text), and so is Bot2's, wherever it is ("all").
# - Woodland Changeling is every creature type (Changeling, a characteristic-defining ability applying first in layer 4,
#   CR 613.3), a Saproling among them: it is a Forest land as well, so it has "{T}: Add {G}" (CR 305.6), and is 1/1 green.
# - A Forest played on turn 3 can't be tapped for mana that turn (summoning sickness, the ruling), while the turn-1 Forest,
#   under Bot1's control since the turn began, can (the positive control). On turn 5 the Changeling taps for {G} and the
#   turn-3 Forest attacks for 1.

[Bot1 Deck]
Forest
Mox Emerald
Mox Ruby
Mox Pearl
Life and Limb
Woodland Changeling
Forest
Plains
Plains x15

[Bot2 Deck]
Forest
Island x30

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Forest.Play
Bot1.Hand.Mox Emerald.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Ruby.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Pearl.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Life and Limb.Cast
Bot1.Battlefield.Forest.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Emerald.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Ruby.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Pearl.Activate
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
? Bot1.Battlefield.Forest.Types = Land; Creature
? Bot1.Battlefield.Forest.Subtypes = Forest; Saproling
? Bot1.Battlefield.Forest.Colors = Green
? Bot1.Battlefield.Forest.Power = 1
? Bot1.Battlefield.Forest.SummoningSick = true
[T2 Bot2.Main1]
Bot2.Hand.Forest.Play
? Bot2.Battlefield.Forest.Types = Land; Creature
[T3 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Hand.Forest.Play
! Bot1.Battlefield.Forest#2.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Woodland Changeling.Cast
Bot1.Battlefield.Forest#1.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Emerald.Activate
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
? Bot1.Battlefield.Woodland Changeling.Types = Creature; Land
? Bot1.Battlefield.Woodland Changeling.Subtypes = (every creature type); Forest
? Bot1.Battlefield.Woodland Changeling.Power = 1
? Bot1.Battlefield.Woodland Changeling.Toughness = 1
? Bot1.Battlefield.Woodland Changeling.Colors = Green
[T5 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Battlefield.Woodland Changeling.Activate
? Bot1.Mana = {G}
Bot1.Attack(Forest#2 > Bot2)
[T5 Bot1.Main2]

[Expect]
Turn = 5
Bot2.Life = 19
Bot2.Battlefield.Forest.Subtypes = Forest; Saproling
Bot2.Battlefield.Forest.Colors = Green
Bot1.Battlefield.Life and Limb.Types = Enchantment
